WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.935 --> 00:00:05.005
SURFER:
<i> Nazaré is absolutely firing.</i>

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.673
<i> There's 30,000 people
 on the cliff.</i>

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:10.609
<i> There's more hype,
 there's more ego,</i>

00:00:10.709 --> 00:00:11.644
<i> there's more fame.</i>

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:15.248
And that all leads up
to one breaking point.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.287
♪ (TENSE PIANO MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:23.089
CJ MACIAS:
<i> Garrett has this deep drive.</i>

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:26.925
There's something about
the way he'll believe in you.

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:29.128
I love seeing people
accomplishing their goals,

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:31.130
their dreams,
doing what they love.

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:32.965
For me, surfing is a religion.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:36.936
<i> It's a mix of pure adrenalin,
 fear, and happiness.</i>

00:00:37.503 --> 00:00:39.005
JUSTINE DUPONT:
<i> I do it because I love it.</i>

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.073
If I don't have a smile
on my face,

00:00:41.173 --> 00:00:42.575
<i> it's not worth it.</i>

00:00:43.175 --> 00:00:44.677
I've always seen her
like a superhero.

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:45.878
<i> Nothing can happen to her.</i>

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:49.515
SURFER 2:
<i> This is what I want to do
 for the rest of my life.</i>

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:52.719
Every season, you wanna perform,
you wanna do your best.

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:55.120
<i> It'll make your career
 or break it.</i>

00:00:55.554 --> 00:00:58.124
DUPONT:<i> You need to push
yourself if you want to succeed.</i>

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.661
But sometimes,
I feel like it's too much.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.832
SURFER 3:<i> I want to prove
 that I'm not a kid anymore.</i>

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:09.736
MACIAS:<i> The fear,
 the love, the stress.</i>

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:14.741
<i> Why do I need such
 an extreme circumstance...</i>

00:01:16.775 --> 00:01:18.545
<i> in order to feel alive?</i>

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:22.215
Oh, my God.
I don't see him anywhere!

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:27.353
GARRETT MCNAMARA:
<i> I've never seen Nicole
 so afraid.</i>

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:29.655
She needed me
to be there for her.

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:33.492
KAI LENNY:<i> The biggest enemy
 that you have to overcome
 is your own mind.</i>

00:01:33.592 --> 00:01:34.993
<i> When you start
 doubting yourself,</i>

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:36.329
you might not come home at all.

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:40.499
SPEAKER:<i> People don't realize
 we put everything on the line.</i>

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.470
We know that sometimes
we only get one shot.

